                <pb facs="0604" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg522"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/2507.</note>
                <head>[Telegram–Paraphrase.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nuevo Laredo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 19,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Forty-five rifles and 20,000 cartridges captured to-day by commander of Fort
                    McIntosh, also a lieutenant in the revolutionary army, who states he is
                    commissioned by Gen. Reyes personally.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
